> There[�]�s a lot of vague, fluffy talk about self-care. I’[m] a[ fan] of practical, tangible, actionable. If you are too, this is for you.
Magnificent Mornings[ is] the live[ workshop] I lead[ all] about discovering and creating your ideal morning routine, one that allows you to[ show] up as the best version of yourself, with ease.
Can’t make the live[ version] or just prefer to go at[ your own] pace? Then this self-paced version is for you.
This cooking guide includes 29 simple, easy, stress-reducing recipes that are all plant-based and gluten-free.
